      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 27 Fortitude save</p>\n<p><strong>Onset</strong> 1 day</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> Enfeebled 1 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> Enfeebled 2 (1 day).</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>This swarm of thousands of fist-sized ticks forms a moving carpet of bloated insects-a nauseating and intimidating sight.</p>",
